# Data license

The *code* in this repository is licensed under the MIT License (see `LICENSE`).
This file covers the *data*: everything under `data/`, the raw snapshots on the
`data-raw` branch, and any derived JSON published by the website.

## Upstream

Poll data is obtained from the dawum.de API. dawum publishes its database under
the **Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0**.

## Consequence for this project

The normalized tables and model outputs in this repository are a derived
database under ODbL terms. They are therefore published under the **same
license**, ODbL v1.0, with attribution to dawum.de.

Canonical license text: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

